{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Census Comparison & Invoice Reconciliation Agent API",
    "description": "\n### Automated Census Creation and Multi-Document Reconciliation Engine\n\nThis API automates health insurance underwriting workflows:\n- **Intake & OCR**: Ingests PDFs (scanned & digital via PaddleOCR), Excel, CSV, and Word documents.\n- **Classification**: Distinguishes Census, Invoices, Renewals, GHQs, and RFPs.\n- **Carrier Routing**: Assigns carrier (Florida Blue vs Cigna) and master template (RAPT, Marsh, SBU).\n- **Prospect Extraction**: Employs Claude (`claude-opus-5-5`) for precise prospect metadata extraction.\n- **Reconciliation**: Validates tiers, enrollment status (Active, Waived, Cobra), flags discrepancies, and aligns renewal rates.\n- **Deliverables**: Outputs standardized protected Excel workbooks, audit exception summaries, and ready-to-send intake emails.\n\n#### Interactive Swagger UI\n- Explore and test endpoints directly below using the **Try it out** button on any endpoint.\n- OpenAPI Schema: [/openapi.json](/openapi.json)\n- ReDoc alternative: [/redoc](/redoc)\n- Direct Swagger route: [/swagger](/swagger) or [/docs](/docs)\n",
    "version": "2.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "System Health"
        ],
        "summary": "Check API and System Status",
        "description": "Check the online health of the server, LLM integration, Poppler OCR status, and directories.",
        "operationId": "health_api_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
